ecounter-end=\"80\" class=\"purecounter\">0</span><span class=\"tp-cn-counter-suffix\">%</span></h2>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-cn-counter-item\">\r\n                           <span class=\"tp-cn-counter-title\">Satisfied clients</span>\r\n                           <h2 class=\"tp-cn-counter-number\"><span class=\"tp-cn-counter-prefix\">></span><span data-purecounter-duration=\"3\" data-purecounter-end=\"90\" class=\"purecounter\">0</span></h2>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n               </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n         </div>\r\n         <!-- counter area end -->\r\n\r\n\r\n         <!-- service area start -->\r\n         <div class=\"tp-at-service-ptb tp-sec-ptb include-bg pt-135 pb-100\" data-bg-color=\"#F7F7F5\" data-background=\"assets/img/accounting/service/service-bg.png\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n               <div class=\"row\">\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-at-service-wrapper mb-40\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-at-service-heading mb-140\">\r\n                           <span class=\"tp-section-sub\">// Our services</span>\r\n                           <h3 class=\"tp-section-title\">Revolutionize your workflow with <br> bookkeeping solutions.</h3>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-at-service-thumb-wrap d-flex gap-3\">\r\n                           <div class=\"tp-at-service-thumb\">\r\n                              <img class=\"radius-6\" src=\"/assets/img/accounting/service/thumb-1.jpg\" alt=\"service\">\r\n                           </div>\r\n                           <div class=\"tp-at-service-thumb\">\r\n                              <img class=\"radius-6\" src=\"/assets/img/accounting/service/thumb-2.jpg\" alt=\"service\">\r\n                           </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-at-service-wrap mb-40\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-industries-service-text mb-80\">\r\n                           <p class=\"mb-25\">\r\n                              The Advanced Manufacturing sector is experiencing unprecedented disruption as five\r\n                              pivotal trends (outlined in our “5 RACES” framework) transform both industry and\r\n                              society. To thrive, companies must strategically decide where to stand out and where to\r\n                              collaborate—even with competitors—through innovative partnerships.\r\n                              Success now requires more than fine-tuning traditional value chains; it demands\r\n                              end-to-end transformation: putting customers at the center, deploying the right digital\r\n                              technologies, and reimagining the organization from the C-suite to the shop floor.\r\n                           </p>\r\n                           <p>\r\n                              In this fast-changing environment, our automotive consulting specialists collaborate\r\n                              with vehicle manufacturers, suppliers, retailers, tech innovators, and mobility service\r\n                              providers to design bold, forward-looking strategies. We empower businesses to\r\n                              maximize current performance while building resilience and positioning them to capture\r\n                              tomorrow’s opportunities.  By aligning technology, talent, and strategy, we help\r\n                              organizations transform challenges into competitive advantage\r\n                              and future-proof their growth.\r\n                           </p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tp-industires-btn\">\r\n                           <a class=\"tp-btn theme-bg-color tp-btn-switch-animation\" href=\"contact.html\">\r\n                              <span class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\">\r\n                                 <span class=\"btn-text\">\r\n                                    Schedule a free call\r\n                                 </span>\r\n                                 <i class=\"btn-icon\"></i>\r\n                                 <i class=\"btn-icon\"></i>\r\n                              </span>\r\n                           </a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                     </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n               </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n         </div>\r\n         <!-- service area end -->\r\n\r\n\r\n         <!-- strategy area start -->\r\n         <div class=\"tp-fa-strategy-ptb tp-sec-ptb pt-135 pb-110\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n               <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n                  <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\r\n                     <div class=\"tp-fa-strategy-content mb-30\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"tp-section-title advisory-color mb-20\">Transforming intelligent strategy <br> into exponential growth.</h3>\r\n                        <p>To achieve an exponential trajectory, a business must aggressively pivot from labor - intensive <br>\r\n                        processes to scalable infrastructure. This involves integrating automation and predictive <br>\r\n                        analytics to eliminate operational friction and human error.</p>\r\n                        <a class=\"tp-btn tp-btn-advisory-style tp-btn-border tp-btn-switch-animation\" href=\"industries-details.html\">\r\n                           <span class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\">\r\n                              <span class=\"btn-text\">\r\n                                 Get started now\r\n   